  "patch": "Register the Windows password window class once per process, so cancellation, retry and the current/new/confirmation sequence can reuse it. Explicitly show requested password prompts after a hidden resident launch. The opt-in desktop regression uses a bounded synthetic child process with STARTF_USESHOWWINDOW/SW_HIDE and checks visible masked prompts before and after cancellation. Unix implementation unchanged."
